+
+/**
+ * The architecture bun names itself with: release assets, the name
+ * `bun upgrade` looks for, and `bun build --compile` targets all use it. Not
+ * `process.arch` — bun spells arm64 "aarch64" and ppc64 "ppc64le"
+ * (`bun_core::env::Architecture`).
+ */
